From bd7123bdb14e990b955c4fe9edb1b5cb3580cbfd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chain: brand daemon and RPC client targets as Lotus

Rename daemon and CLI targets from bitcoind/bitcoin-cli to lotusd/lotus-cli
for the Lotus V2 network.

Original-Commit: 661cb3bed1e31b9f1f241181d1a94ad250d75549
Original-Patch: v2/003
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

(cherry picked from commit 6995c188d79130627f9605b25e3441d3e8ac05bc)

N3 shared-layer test adaptation: completed log-format functionals assert the native Lotus startup prefix instead of Bitcoin ABC at this first CLIENT_NAME consumer. Keep all exact startup-record and format/schema checks; do not weaken the matcher.

Canonical-Source-Commit: 6995c188d79130627f9605b25e3441d3e8ac05bc

Coordinator integration provenance (metrics369):
Set FULLNODE_CLIENT/FULLNODE_CHAIN defaults to lotusd/lotus at the original native branding owner; shared defaults remain ecashd/ecash.
All build/runtime/observer controls deferred by user compile-first policy; ordered source replay is not runtime approval.

Coordinator integration provenance (network403):
Resolve integration context by retaining the incoming purposeful change together with existing shared/native consumers; exact old/new patch and file inventory is retained in owner-adaptations.json. No authored purpose or removed downstream behavior restored.
Original scripted commands/hashes above are original-author provenance; modified parent/tool/catalog hashes are not claimed to reproduce this composition. Exact coordinator adaptation scripts and ordered tree proof are in composed403-network-metrics-delivery. Build/runtime/benchmarks NOT_RUN for this composition under user compile-first policy.

Coordinator ordered integration (2026-10-20):
Existing causal fixes and mechanical namespace/format adaptations are folded at their first responsible owner. Exact inputs and prefix adaptations are recorded in integration-next final delivery; original author provenance is retained.

Retain the five amount-bearing script vectors in atoms while formatting their amounts with the XPI RPC denomination (six decimals), matching the production currency change.
